a returns to The Recruit, who now smirks slightly, sensing Alex's curiosity piqued.)*\n\n**Alex:** Can I really make a difference?\n\n**The Recruit:** *(typing firmly)* Without a doubt. You'll receive training, and we'll make sure you're prepared. Together"
